":["Charges up, then fires a piercing laser bolt."],"behavior":"Its ranked wind-up leads into a range-extended piercing projectile."},{"name":"Citadel Special Two","noun":"CitadelSpecialTwo","slug":"citadelspecialtwo-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":36,"base_hit_points":80,"estimated_hit_points":237.6,"estimated_damage_min":23.9,"estimated_damage_max":39.8,"descriptions":null,"behavior":""},{"name":"Reconstructionist","noun":"CitadelSpecialFour","slug":"citadelspecialfour-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":120,"estimated_hit_points":356.4,"estimated_damage_min":15.9,"estimated_damage_max":26.5,"descriptions":["Ground slam knocks nearby heroes upward; when damaged, repairs itself."],"behavior":"Its phase chooses ranked self-repair while wounded, otherwise radial Ground Slam or close Piston Punch."},{"name":"Shielded Grenadier","noun":"NomadShielder","slug":"nomadshielder-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":35,"base_hit_points":80,"estimated_hit_points":237.6,"estimated_damage_min":8,"estimated_damage_max":15.9,"descriptions":["Frontal shield blocks damage; lobs cluster grenades and knocks back close frontal heroes."],"behavior":"Directional shield admission, cluster submunitions, and the close bash all use their recovered phases."},{"name":"Pouncing Stalker","noun":"NomadBioSpecialTwo","slug":"nomadbiospecialtwo-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":80,"estimated_hit_points":237.6,"estimated_damage_min":21.2,"estimated_damage_max":42.4,"descriptions":["Can close distance quickly with his leap attack.","Will resurrect if killed at the wrong time."],"behavior":"It chooses the authored leap outside Swipe range and its persistent self-resurrection sign now consumes the first lethal hit, restores it at 40 percent health, and resumes combat once."},{"name":"Ragetusk","noun":"NomadSpecialOne","slug":"nomadspecialone-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":120,"estimated_hit_points":356.4,"descriptions":["Charges and knocks heroes up; grows and deals more damage when nearby allies die."],"behavior":"The existing charge and knock-up remain, while each nearby allied death now adds a bounded damage and body-size enrage stack."},{"name":"Caustic Stinger","noun":"VerdanthBasicSkeet","slug":"verdanthbasicskeet-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":5,"base_hit_points":14,"estimated_hit_points":41.6,"estimated_damage_min":10.6,"estimated_damage_max":21.2,"descriptions":["Circles its target and periodically darts in for a fast sting."],"behavior":"Navigation-clipped circle movement alternates with the recovered Darting Attack."},{"name":"Menace Weed","noun":"VerdanthBasicHealer","slug":"verdanthbasichealer-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":4,"base_hit_points":24,"estimated_hit_points":71.3,"estimated_damage_min":5.3,"estimated_damage_max":10.6,"descriptions":["Roots to channel healing near allies; otherwise fires rapid thorns."],"behavior":"The ally-dependent phase selects its repeated six-unit heal aura or its ranked multishot Thorn Dart."},{"name":"Tentacler","noun":"VerdanthBasicPlunge","slug":"verdanthbasicplunge-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":4,"base_hit_points":20,"estimated_hit_points":59.4,"estimated_damage_min":21.2,"estimated_damage_max":31.8,"descriptions":["Causes spiky thorns to emerge from underneath a hero..","Damage can be avoided by staying mobile."],"behavior":"It snapshots the hero’s position, warns there after one second, and damages only actors still inside the strict two-unit radius at 2.5 seconds."},{"name":"Grappling Pulsar","noun":"VerdanthSpecialThree","slug":"verdanthspecialthree-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":35,"base_hit_points":140,"estimated_hit_points":415.8,"descriptions":["Pull victims are slowed, then struck with rapid melee attacks."],"behavior":"The three-second Pulled modifier owns the forced-movement interval, then the phase uses the recovered nine-hit Fast Swipe while Puller cools."},{"name":"Reparatron","noun":"ZelemBasicRepair","slug":"zelembasicrepair-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":4,"base_hit_points":18,"estimated_hit_points":53.5,"estimated_damage_min":10.6,"estimated_damage_max":18.6,"descriptions":["Repairs nearby fallen robots, bringing them back to life if given enough time.","Can use its repair tools as melee weapons if given the opportunity."],"behavior":"It resurrects an eligible nearby robot through the repair channel and otherwise attacks with Arc Welding melee."},{"name":"Pack Brawler","noun":"ZelemBasicPackMelee","slug":"zelembasicpackmelee-noun","role":"Minion","challenge_value":5,"base_hit_points":24,"estimated_hit_points":71.3,"estimated_damage_min":15.9,"estimated_damage_max":23.9,"descriptions":["Believes in the safety of numbers and will cower if alone.","Once an ally is nearby, will work up the courage to deliver a powerful melee attack."],"behavior":"It cowers without a living ally inside the authored 20-unit check and admits its ranked melee when supported."},{"name":"Hypno Mantis","noun":"CryosSpecialThree","slug":"cryosspecialthree-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":100,"estimated_hit_points":297,"descriptions":["Lobs a small sleeping cloud, then closes on sleeping heroes for a melee swipe."],"behavior":"Sleep Mushroom creates the three-tick radius-two cloud and close targets switch to Rez Melee."},{"name":"Lightning Juggernaut","noun":"Boomer","slug":"boomer-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":100,"estimated_hit_points":297,"descriptions":["Attacks with energy damage when up close.","explodes upon death.","Charges its target, explodes upon death"],"behavior":"Footprint-aware charge pursuit hands off to Smash at close range without rejecting that secondary melee phase, and death starts cast_explode before the recovered 1.3-second, seven-unit elemental-energy detonation at the defeated world position."}]}}
